        <p class="text-amber-800 text-lg">Apply the same pattern to your real business: one trigger, one filter, three actions, one owner. Complete the exercise and test thoroughly before adding complexity.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Action Steps -->
  <div class="bg-gradient-to-br from-emerald-50 to-teal-50 rounded-2xl p-6 border-2 border-emerald-200">
    <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-5">
      <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-emerald-100 flex items-center justify-center">
        <svg class="w-6 h-6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 5H7a2 2 0 00-2 2v12a2 2 0 002 2h10a2 2 0 002-2V7a2 2 0 00-2-2h-2M9 5a2 2 0 002 2h2a2 2 0 002-2M9 5a2 2 0 012-2h2a2 2 0 012 2m-6 9l2 2 4-4"/></svg>
      </div>
      <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-emerald-900">Action Steps — Module 10 Complete</h3>
    </div>
    
    <div class="space-y-4">
      
      <div class="flex items-start gap-4 bg-white rounded-xl p-4 shadow-sm">
        <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-emerald-500 text-white flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-lg flex-shrink-0">1</div>
        <div>
          <p class="font-semibold text-slate-900">Choose Your Scenario</p>
          <p class="text-slate-600 text-sm">Pick the scenario closest to your business or create your own.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="flex items-start gap-4 bg-white rounded-xl p-4 shadow-sm">
        <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-emerald-500 text-white flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-lg flex-shrink-0">2</div>
        <div>
          <p class="font-semibold text-slate-900">Complete Exercise Steps</p>
          <p class="text-slate-600 text-sm">Work through all eight steps: trigger, form, email, owner, response time, build, test, correct.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="flex items-start gap-4 bg-white rounded-xl p-4 shadow-sm">
        <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-emerald-500 text-white flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-lg flex-shrink-0">3</div>
        <div>
          <p class="font-semibold text-slate-900">Reach the Finish Line</p>
          <p class="text-slate-600 text-sm">Ensure all completion criteria are met before considering the workflow done.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>',
      title = 'Adapt the Workflow to Your Business',
      lesson_number = 7,
      sort_order = 7,
      updated_at = NOW()
    WHERE id = v_lesson_id;
    
    RAISE NOTICE 'Updated lesson: Adapt the Workflow to Your Business';
  END IF;

END $$;


-- Insert Quiz Questions for Lesson: Adapt the Workflow to Your Business

DO $$
DECLARE
  v_module_id UUID;
  v_lesson_id UUID;
  v_quiz_id UUID;
BEGIN
  -- Get Module by week number
  SELECT id INTO v_module_id FROM public.training_modules WHERE week_number = 10 LIMIT 1;
  
  IF v_module_id IS NULL THEN
    RAISE NOTICE 'Module 10 not found';
    RETURN;
  END IF;

  -- Get the lesson ID
  SELECT id INTO v_lesson_id 
  FROM public.lessons 
  WHERE slug = 'adapt-workflow-business' AND module_id = v_module_id;
  
  IF v_lesson_id IS NULL THEN
    RAISE NOTICE 'Lesson adapt-workflow-business not found in module 10';
    RETURN;
  END IF;
  
  -- Delete existing quizzes to avoid duplicates
  DELETE FROM public.lesson_quizzes WHERE lesson_id = v_lesson_id;


  -- Question 1
  INSERT INTO public.lesson_quizzes (lesson_id, question, options, correct_answer, explanation, sort_order)
  VALUES (
    v_lesson_id, 
    'What is the first step in adapting the workflow?', 
    '["Immediately add complex features","Choose your scenario and write the trigger event","Delete the existing workflow","Skip testing"]'::jsonb,
    'Choose your scenario and write the trigger event',
    'The first step is to choose your scenario and document the exact trigger event that starts your workflow. Planning before building prevents errors.', 
    1
  )
  RETURNING id INTO v_quiz_id;


  -- Question 2
  INSERT INTO public.lesson_quizzes (lesson_id, question, options, correct_answer, explanation, sort_order)
  VALUES (
    v_lesson_id, 
    'What should you do after the first workflow works?', 
    '["Immediately add ten more actions","Add one improvement at a time and test again","Never touch it again","Delete it and start over"]'::jsonb,
    'Add one improvement at a time and test again',
    'Once the first workflow works, add improvements one at a time: tasks, pipeline entries, waits, reminders. Test again after every change.', 
    2
  )
  RETURNING id INTO v_quiz_id;


  -- Question 3
  INSERT INTO public.lesson_quizzes (lesson_id, question, options, correct_answer, explanation, sort_order)
  VALUES (
    v_lesson_id, 
    'What is the finish line for this exercise?', 
    '["The workflow is created in Draft","Form starts workflow, confirmation sent, tag added, notification received, activity shows completion, owner named","The workflow has 20 actions","It looks pretty"]'::jsonb,
    'Form starts workflow, confirmation sent, tag added, notification received, activity shows completion, owner named',
    'The finish line requires: form starts workflow, test contact receives confirmation, inquiry-new tag added, notification received, workflow activity shows completed path, and a named person owns the next action.', 
    3
  )
  RETURNING id INTO v_quiz_id;

END $$;
